{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":16.32},{"sectionId":"build","start":17.84,"end":36.24},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.96,"end":49.2}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.88,"text":"函式把明確的輸入轉為輸出。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":4.08,"end":6.56,"text":"與其為每件作品重複標記，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":6.92,"end":9.76,"text":"不如把一個字典產生成文章，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":10.16,"end":12.72,"text":"再為每個項目呼叫函式。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":13.36,"end":14.72,"text":"把文章接起來，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":14.8,"end":16.32,"text":"就得到網站主體。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":17.84,"end":18.88,"text":"把 /chapter2."},{"sectionId":"build","start":19.093,"end":23.68,"text":"py 的 return \"\" 改為示範的 article 表達式。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":24.72,"end":25.36,"text":"執行後，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":25.84,"end":28.56,"text":"產生的檔案中應出現 index."},{"sectionId":"build","start":28.752,"end":29.52,"text":"html，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":29.92,"end":32.32,"text":"而且預覽中應有作品。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":33.88,"end":36.24,"text":"為什麼要從函式回傳文章？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":37.96,"end":40.4,"text":"為什麼要從函式回傳文章？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":41.92,"end":46,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":46.64,"end":49.2,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}